  "2019 P2 Q7(a)(b)": {"skill":"Find the mean and standard deviation of the 2017 weights, then compare them with 1987.","method":"(a) 4 marks, (b) 2 marks","moves":["What do you need before you can find how spread out the weights are?","(a)(i) Find the mean.","(a)(ii) Take the mean from each weight and square the results.","(a)(ii) Add the squares and put the total into the standard deviation formula.","(a)(ii) Work out the standard deviation.","(b) Compare the means in words, saying which year's babies were heavier on average.","(b) Compare the standard deviations, saying which year's weights were more consistent."],"marks":[0,1,1,1,1,1,1],"shows":[null,"\\((2.5 + 4.5 + 3.7 + 3.1 + 3.8 + 3.4) \\div 6 = 3.5\\)","\\(1, 1, 0.04, 0.16, 0.09, 0.01\\)","\\(\\sqrt{\\frac{2.3}{6 - 1}}\\)","\\(0.678\\ldots\\)","on average weights in 2017 are higher",null],"watch":{"at":5,"text":"Say \"on average\" for the mean, and talk about the babies' weights."}},
