  "2025 P1 Q4 (a) - (d)": {"skill":"Find the median and quartiles, draw a box plot, find the interquartile range and compare it with Lewis's.","method":"(a) 2 marks, (b) 2 marks, (c) 1 mark, (d) 1 mark","moves":["What must you do to the eight times before you can find a median?","(a) Put the times in order and find the median, halfway between the middle two.","(a) Find the median of each half: those are the quartiles.","(b) Mark the lowest and highest times on the scale.","(b) Mark the three quartiles and draw the box and whiskers.","(c) Subtract the lower quartile from the upper quartile.","(d) Compare the two interquartile ranges, saying whose times were more consistent."],"marks":[0,1,1,1,1,1,1],"shows":[null,null,"\\((Q_1 =)\\ 23\\), \\((Q_3 =)\\ 34\\)","end points at \\(21\\) and \\(37\\)","box showing \\(Q_1\\), \\(Q_2\\), \\(Q_3\\)","\\((34 - 23 =)\\ 11\\)",null],"watch":{"at":6,"text":"Do not say \"on average\" when comparing interquartile ranges: they measure spread."}},
